Time Constraints
 \begin{itemize}
 \item Simulation
 \begin{itemize}
 \item offline, non-realtime
 \item each calculation (transition matrix, Kalman gain, etc.) can run to completion
 \item do not have to worry about rate group partitioning
 \end{itemize}
\end{itemize}
\end{slide}
